## Interface: 30300
## Title: Journal: Progression
## Notes: Adds a Progression tab to the Journal: your mod-individual-progression stage, and in order everything to do there to reach the next one - levels, attunement quest chains with who gives them and where, keys to carry, and each raid's bosses down to the one whose kill moves you on. /progression opens it.
